# Committed build output. These are generated by
# `pnpm --filter @templatical/email-skill run bundle-vendor` and shipped so the
# agent skill needs no install step — review the tool and the freshness test,
# not the minified bundle. `linguist-generated` collapses them in PR diffs and
# drops them from the repo's language stats; `-diff` keeps `git diff` from
# printing 100+ KB of minified output. File names still appear in
# `--name-only`, so the plugin-version guard is unaffected.
skills/templatical-email/vendor/*.mjs linguist-generated=true -diff
